--- A record parameter the body only keeps in a field of another record
--- (`k.bars = b`) is copied there: lent to the function, the field had
--- been given the reference, and the compiled program did not build
--- (Kite's `set_bars`, 2026-11-07)
struct Bars [c]
struct Chart [bars, n]

fn set_bars[k, b, n]
    k.bars = b
    k.n = n
    k

fn data[k, b]
    set_bars[k, b, 2]

k = Chart[Bars[[1.0]], 0]
k = data[k, Bars[[1.0, 2.0]]]
log[k.n]
log[k.bars.c]
